  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W45",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "红风暴本周表现突出，七场比赛拿下三个冠军，而且全部由同一人（Kampo）席卷。高分占比14.0%，已收录对局65胜34负，胜率65.7%。纯红疯魔虽然仍以16.7%的高分占比排在第一，胜率却只有47.4%。",
          "en": "Ruby Storm won three of the seven Pauper events this week, all in the hands of Kampo. It accounted for 14.0% of high-scoring decks and went 65–34 in recorded non-mirror matches for a 65.7% win rate. Mono-Red Madness still led the high-score field at 16.7% and posted a 47.4% win rate."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]也继续进入其他套牌。带两张[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]、两张[[card:Gurmag Angler|谷尔玛钓客]]的蓝黑仙灵拿下四强：deck:af9302d1d357c8dcea35。",
          "en": "[[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] is finding its way into more decks. A Dimir Faeries list with two copies each of [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] and [[card:Gurmag Angler|Gurmag Angler]] made the Top 4 at deck:af9302d1d357c8dcea35."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:af9302d1d357c8dcea35",
            "label": {
              "zh": "蓝黑仙灵 · Beicodegeia · 第3名",
              "en": "Dimir Faeries · Beicodegeia · Rank 3"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "dimir-faeries",
              "display_name": "Dimir Faeries",
