              "starttime": "2026-11-07 10:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "另外，全新构筑的红蓝控制拿下55人挑战赛亚军：deck:6c4fb4cf23bf30b1b7a7。[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]和[[card:Plunder the Trollshaws|劫掠食人妖森林]]都满编，再带两张[[card:Campfire|营火]]回血和回收坟场。",
          "en": "A fresh Izzet Control build finished second in a 55-player Challenge at deck:6c4fb4cf23bf30b1b7a7. It runs four each of [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] and [[card:Plunder the Trollshaws|Plunder the Trollshaws]], plus two copies of [[card:Campfire|Campfire]] to gain life or shuffle the graveyard back into the library."
        },
